WEBVTT

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:35.110
Go, Shoot!

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.500
Dranzer!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:16.150
Kai clashed with Goki at full charge.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.860
He wants revenge for Yuya.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:23.990
But those thoughts began to
distract Kai more and more.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:29.250
Combined with the enemy's plans,
he lost sight of his own battle.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.840
But Kai remained a strong Blader.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:37.340
But he was able to clear his mind,
and get revenge for Yuya.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.850
Kai's approach to his
battle moved us all,

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:52.860
and showed us what it
really means to battle!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.960
That was an amazing battle.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.840
I hope you were
able to avenge Yuya.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.340
It's all thanks to Kinomiya.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.970
You taught me something
important too, Kai.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.440
You were cool as heck, Kai.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.690
Goki!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.650
Curses!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.870
End of the line, Doctor.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.750
You bring shame to Psykick.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.960
Finally your turn, Kane.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.340
Yeah.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.510
Kane.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:06.470
You must obtain Seiryu.
No matter the cost.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.060
If you do, we can earn another chance.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:16.190
Mr. Gideon, Seiryu is the best
of the four Sacred Beasts.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:23.450
If we take Seiryu, we can get
the other two we missed.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:27.870
Which means the next
battle is extremely important.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.950
It's as you say, sir.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.460
It's all up to you, Kane.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.790
Leave it to me, Mr. Gideon.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.840
I will completely destroy him.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.590
It's finally my time to shine.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.690
This is our battlefield, huh?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.190
I will never lose!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.950
BBA team.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:09.990
This is the last battle
of the deathmatch.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:16.670
I've enjoyed how surprisingly
intense these battles were.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:20.000
Hurry up and get Kane out here!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.510
Kinomiya is as straightforward as ever.
You've certainly got energy.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.970
But just how long will
that energy last you?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.430
What?!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.930
Well, Kinomiya, here's the
Blader you've been waiting for.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.610
Kane Yamashita has arrived.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.180
Kane...

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.980
Let's go, Kane!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.930
Yeah!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.230
Activate system 008!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.910
What is all that?

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:34.120
Those lights are made of high-voltage ions!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.710
What is this, Doctor?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:43.920
I've prepared a stage that'll
be perfect for those two.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.670
These parlor tricks ain't
gonna won't work on me!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.300
You'll see how much of a
parlor trick it is once we battle.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.970
What?!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:03.190
Kane...

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.360
--Shoot!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.330
I wanted to finish our
battle with the real you.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.380
I will defeat you!

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.170
I'll beat you in my own style!

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.930
This battle isn't about you or me!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.510
Only about the winner and loser!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:35.640
--Here we go!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.430
--Three! Two! One!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.730
--Go, Shoot!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.070
Good going, Takao!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.940
Don't let up, Dragoon!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.410
Cyber Dragoon!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.450
What?!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.920
Look out!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:24.940
The plan is to give his Bey a beating
before bringing out the Sacred Beast.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.520
I see.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.570
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.960
This isn't good!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:56.550
Keep up the attack,
Cyber Dragoon!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.730
Not a chance!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.480
Bring it!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.070
--Go!!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.300
What?!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.270
That's low!
Why don't you fight fairly?!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.940
You're still going on about that?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:00.830
Go! Cyber Dragoon!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.620
Suffer!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.670
Grind to pieces, Dragoon!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.970
Go!!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:30.980
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.950
Takao... You can do it...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:58.880
Is that it?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.300
I'll take care of this!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.700
Another miss, huh?

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:32.170
We gotta save Genbu now!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.750
Where the hell is
this control room?!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.590
How am I supposed to know?

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.920
Right, Yusuf?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.180
This building's just too big.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:48.020
Okay. Let's split up and
look for this control room.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.180
--See ya!
--Yeah!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:57.070
Hang in there!
You gotta hang on, Dragoon!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:03.450
Go! Cyber Dragoon!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.340
Dragoon!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.550
Well? What's with that look in your eyes?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.060
Are you frustrated?
Face the facts!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:34.600
In battles, there are
only winners and losers!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.570
I... won't let you...

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.730
Huh?

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.150
Get away... with this...

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.660
What's the matter?
What're you saying?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.160
Out with it!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.160
I'm not letting you...

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.750
Get away with this!!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.250
Silence!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.260
That's it! Keep it up, Dragoon!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.780
Wow...

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.780
Takao put all his anger into Dragoon!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.410
What're you zoning out for?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.880
Hurry up and summon the
digital Sacred Beast, Kane!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.420
Kane...

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.930
Keep attacking, Dragoon!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.770
Go!!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.980
It isn't just about the Beys
clashing against each other.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.690
It's about two Bladers throwing
everything they've got at each other.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.860
That's what a real battle is!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.980
I refuse to lose to
some artificial Blader!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.280
An artificial... Blader?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:51.370
Yeah! Right now you're just a
machine created by the Psykicks!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.290
No!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.250
I...

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.370
Am no machine!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.840
I'm Kane Yamashita!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.060
I'll put everything on
the line to fight you!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.390
And defeat you!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.390
Oh yeah!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.520
Go!!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.950
Yes! Keep attacking, Cyber Dragoon!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.040
I can feel it!
I feel it, Kane!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.120
I accept your spirit!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.210
Go, Dragoon!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:51.130
It's like a do-over of
their battle at the river!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.180
Yeah.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.590
But why?

00:15:53.590 --> 00:16:00.430
Takao's fighting spirit has reawakened Kane,
who was possessed by the digital Sacred Beast.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.350
That's just the kind
of guy Kinomiya is.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:16.240
Why?! Why won't Kane summon
his digital Sacred Beast?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.660
You needn't worry.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.790
The digital Sacred Beast will
appear with or without him.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:30.130
Cyber Dragoon will soon
reach critical rotation!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.050
150! 200!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.300
250!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.400
The digital Sacred Beast
is about to appear!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.830
Bring it!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.050
Stay put!!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.390
Doctor! What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:28.770
Kane has sealed the digital Sacred
Beast as it was about to release!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:29.900
Incredible!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.070
I don't need the power
of a Sacred Beast.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.820
I'll beat you with
my own strength!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.570
Just the way I want it, Kane!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.320
What the hell are you doing?!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:42.240
Kane, I knew you could...!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.580
Go, Dragoon!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.590
Attack from behind!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.770
You won't get away!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.370
The digital Sacred Beast is rising!

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:48.640
There it is! Cyber Dragoon
has made its appearance!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.280
He said he wouldn't
summon his Sacred Beast...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.150
He didn't! It came
out all on its own!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:05.660
Kane's desire to win has drawn
out the digital Sacred Beast.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.680
No one can go against the
power of a digital Sacred Beast.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.270
I...

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:37.280
Will never rely on the power
of the digital Sacred Beast!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:43.280
On the contrary,
I will master it and the Beyblade!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:04.760
Come on out, Seiryu!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.740
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.860
Don't let Seiryu get away!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.460
This is bad!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.580
What?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:37.250
I can see signs that the digital
Sacred Beast is about to evolve again!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:50.100
The Sacred Beast index
is increasing rapidly!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:54.690
500! 550! 600! 650!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.190
700! 800!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.400
900!

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:02.110
Takao and Kane's battle rages on intensely.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:07.940
The digital Sacred Beast has four more, I mean far more power than expected!

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:10.490
What's the source of its power, anyway?

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:13.160
Me? I make sure my body's washed every morning, and--

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.240
That's a shower! Not power!

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:19.580
It's so lonely doing jokes by myself without the Chairman...

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:21.960
Please hurry back!
